OL,5,G1700 Witness History
OL,6,     FIn 1996, a fossil unearthed in
OL,7,     FChina delivered the first hard
OL,8,     Fproof behind a once-divisive
OL,9,     Ftheory: that some dinosaurs
OL,10,     Fsprouted feathers and ultimately
OL,11,     Fgave rise to modern birds.
